DESCRIPTION >
    tier_events — $WIF holder snapshot (runs ≤1×/day per wallet, when the
    24h cache expires, and right after every top-up).
SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime `json:$.timestamp`,
    `wallet` String `json:$.wallet`,
    `holder` Bool `json:$.holder`,
    `wif_balance` UInt64 `json:$.wif_balance`
ENGINE >
    MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY >
    timestamp, wallet
